WEBVTT

00:11:00.698 --> 00:11:03.367
If it's too hard to shower today,

00:11:03.367 --> 00:11:04.910
grab the baby wipes.

00:11:05.577 --> 00:11:08.205
It may not be the normal way to do it,

00:11:08.205 --> 00:11:10.082
but you deserve to be clean.

00:11:11.917 --> 00:11:14.586
If it's too hard to cook dinner,

00:11:14.628 --> 00:11:16.672
get paper plates,

00:11:16.714 --> 00:11:18.006
heat up something frozen.

00:11:18.048 --> 00:11:20.426
You’ll go back to cooking
and washing another day,

00:11:20.426 --> 00:11:21.969
but the day is not today.

00:11:22.010 --> 00:11:23.345
And in the meantime,

00:11:23.387 --> 00:11:25.222
you deserve to eat.

00:11:26.557 --> 00:11:28.642
If you're too depressed to do your dishes,

00:11:28.684 --> 00:11:31.478
get a two-gallon Ziploc bag
and keep it in your bedroom.